Warmaster Revolution List Builder
==================================

Credit
------
This project was initially based on dsusco/wm-selector
(https://github.com/dsusco/wm-selector), the original open-source Warmaster
army selector. Thanks to its author and contributors for the army data and the
validation logic that this rebuild started from.

Icons
-----
The faction emblems come from game-icons.net
(https://game-icons.net) by Lorc, Delapouite and Kier Heyl, licensed under
CC BY 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). The background
square was removed and some emblems are mirrored. The interface icons are Font
Awesome Free
(https://fontawesome.com), licensed under CC BY 4.0
(https://fontawesome.com/license/free).

